{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisite: Dwarf\n\nYou have the blood of dwarf heroes flowing through your veins. You gain the following benefits:\n\n- Increase your Constitution score by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n\n- Whenever you fail a saving throw or ability check, you can add your Constitution modifier (minimum of 1) to the check, you can add your potentially turning the roll into a success.\n\nAfter you have succeed in a number of rolls  using this feature equal to your proficiency bonus, you can\u0027t use it again until you finish a long rest.","level":1}],"id":"Customfb459124-615c-401c-8c9b-060b9d546bb7","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Dwarven Fortitude [SM] [R]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}